                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "233207304",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198103804264",
                            "num_reviews": 10,
                            "playtime_forever": 135,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 71,
                            "last_played": 1787528143
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "If you can't afford the latest WWE game, I highly recommend this game. This is the most hilarious game I've played in a while. It's janky, wacked out, and many times this happen that make no sense, like my manager being ejected but not really from the no DQ match. While it doesn't have a CAW mode, you can edit any in-game character you want, including editing their moves and parts. \n\nOh, and I not only got to ride a motorcycle right into the ring pole, taking out me, my opponent, my manager, and the ref all in one shot. Then, in the same match, somebody tried to put the merch table in the ring, and it proceeded to spontaneously burst into flames. And you can DDT right into a guillotine choke, something I wish modern games had.\n\nTemper your expectations, and you'll have a blast.",
                        "timestamp_created": 1787157948,
